Cmn4=the program, useful when panels are mobile.\\System Power Off Confirmed\\
Cmn5=this should be tied to the system off confirmed button press on||1
Cmn6=a system off confirmation page\\if your signals are tied appropriately||1
Cmn7=then when the system turns off, all panels will go to the splash||1
Cmn8=page when the system turns off\\System Power On Pulse\\a pulsed||1
